+11. **Select placeholder cut off** at 200% text. **[mechanical]**
+12. **The empty state uses `adp-h1`**, the same level as the page h1. Fix: `compact`. **[mechanical]**
+13. **The inline "Add the game" link is 16px tall.** **[mechanical]**
