From 095ddb8920c205b7128a53d15951b1e0fe76764c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 1 Oct 2026 07:28:50 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/6] fix: align the UI with the updated agent's rules

- Header: the signed-in email, the role badge and the Admin/Questions
  link move into an Account menu (desktop) and the menu's Account
  section (phones); the persistent bar keeps the logo, navigation and
  controls only. The role badge no longer sits in the header.
- Selected pills (view, sort, build, answer pills) are a mint tint with
  a mint border instead of a solid mint fill, which is reserved for the
  screen's one primary action.
- The catalogue sidebar (persistent chrome) drops its explanatory note;
  the stars show what is pinned.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_0158uxufnvDxf4SMdnVi7Gjt
